        <text>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Dear &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);&quot;&gt;{!GetContact.Name}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;We are pleased to inform you that your proposal for the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Wadhwani Innovation Network Centre of Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt; has been &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;approved&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;The next step is signing the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Grant Agreement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;. You will receive the document for signatures shortly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Best Regards,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt; WIN Management Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</text>
